# ============================================================
# Mosquitto ACL —— 智聊·老年关怀模块
# 主题权限最小化：老年端只能发自己的事件、收自己的命令；
# 后端服务拥有全主题权限；子女端 APP 直连默认不启用。
# ============================================================

# ---- 后端服务：全主题读写 ----
user zhiliao-server
topic readwrite zhiliao/v1/#

# ---- 老年端：每人一条（由 scripts/generate-mqtt-passwd.sh 按elder表自动生成）----
# 模板（elderId 替换为实际值）：
# user elder_xxx
# topic write zhiliao/v1/elder/elder_xxx/event/#
# topic write zhiliao/v1/elder/elder_xxx/status
# topic read  zhiliao/v1/elder/elder_xxx/command

# ---- 老年端设备账号（elder_001 / MAC 90:70:69:f7:f1:44）----
user elder_001
topic write zhiliao/v1/elder/elder_001/event/#
topic write zhiliao/v1/elder/elder_001/status
topic read  zhiliao/v1/elder/elder_001/command

# ---- 老年端设备账号（elder_1a593e2d8acd / MAC 90:70:69:f7:f1:44）----
user elder_1a593e2d8acd
topic write zhiliao/v1/elder/elder_1a593e2d8acd/event/#
topic write zhiliao/v1/elder/elder_1a593e2d8acd/status
topic read  zhiliao/v1/elder/elder_1a593e2d8acd/command
